 [:db/cas 17592186278354 :question/problem "![](images/09/0963fc3c56b5baac68e2d587896bf4655950640ecce5b924edc2d8e26a3e64e2.png)\n\nConsider the square region $Δ$ in the $uv$-plane, given by\n\n$$\nΔ={(u,v)\\,:\\,0\\le u\\le \\sqrt{3},\\,\\,0\\le v\\le \\frac{\\pi }{4}},\n$$\n\nand the transformation $T,$ given by\n\n$$\nT:(u,v)\\to (u\\operatorname{cos}⁡v,\\,u\\operatorname{sin}⁡v).\n$$\n\nThe image of the bottom side of $Δ$ under the action of $T$ is a line segment. Which of the following statements are true regarding the image?\n\n- The image makes the angle of $0$ with the positive $x$-axis.\n- The image makes the angle of $\\frac{\\pi }{4}$ with the positive $x$-axis.\n- One endpoint of the image is the origin $O$ of the $xy$-plane, and the other endpoint lies on the circle of radius $\\sqrt{3}$ centered at $O.$" "![](images/09/0963fc3c56b5baac68e2d587896bf4655950640ecce5b924edc2d8e26a3e64e2.png)\n\nConsider the square region $Δ$ in the $uv$-plane, given by\n\n$$\nΔ={(u,v)\\,:\\,0\\le u\\le \\sqrt{3},\\,\\,0\\le v\\le \\frac{\\pi }{4}},\n$$\n\nand the transformation $T,$ given by\n\n$$\nT:(u,v)\\to (u\\operatorname{cos}⁡v,\\,u\\operatorname{sin}⁡v).\n$$\n\nThe image of the bottom side of $Δ$ under the action of $T$ is a line segment. Which of the following statements are true regarding the image?\n\n- The image makes the angle of $0$ with the positive $x$-axis.\n- The image makes the angle of $\\frac{\\pi }{4}$ with the positive $x$-axis.\n- One endpoint of the image is the origin $O$ of the $xy$-plane, and the other endpoint lies on the circle of radius $\\sqrt{3}$ centered at $O.$\n\nSelect all that apply."]
