 [:db/cas 17592186278386 :question/problem "![](images/7b/7bb6d2b9f9e09de44e078657ce3517bfd78261d3206743b7882abf0112f38a93.png)\n\nThe region $R$ is bounded by the planes $x=0$, $x=1$, $y=0$, $y=1$, $z=0,$ and $z=3-x+y.$ Given its representation \n\n$$\nR={(x,y,z)\\,:\\,(x,y)\\in D,\\,{f}_{1}(x,y)\\le z\\le {f}_{2}(x,y)}\n$$\n\n \nas a type I region in three-dimensional space, which of the following statements are true?\n\n- $D={(x,y)\\,:\\,0\\le x\\le 1,\\,0\\le y\\le 3}$\n- ${f}_{1}(x,y)=0$ and ${f}_{2}(x,y)=3-x+y$\n- ${f}_{1}(x,y)=1$ and ${f}_{2}(x,y)=4$" "![](images/7b/7bb6d2b9f9e09de44e078657ce3517bfd78261d3206743b7882abf0112f38a93.png)\n\nThe region $R$ is bounded by the planes $x=0$, $x=1$, $y=0$, $y=1$, $z=0,$ and $z=3-x+y.$ Given its representation \n\n$$\nR={(x,y,z)\\,:\\,(x,y)\\in D,\\,{f}_{1}(x,y)\\le z\\le {f}_{2}(x,y)}\n$$\n\n \nas a type I region in three-dimensional space, which of the following statements are true?\n\n- $D={(x,y)\\,:\\,0\\le x\\le 1,\\,0\\le y\\le 3}$\n- ${f}_{1}(x,y)=0$ and ${f}_{2}(x,y)=3-x+y$\n- ${f}_{1}(x,y)=1$ and ${f}_{2}(x,y)=4$\n\nSelect all that apply."]
